# `C97`'s third column, leg one. `services.config` plus the one line an absolute target requires
# (`requireAllowHostsForAbsolute`), kept as its own file so the `C97`/`C98` diagonal's inputs stay
# byte-identical.

env local default
  api "http://127.0.0.1:4507/base"
  api second "http://127.0.0.1:4507/second"
  allow hosts "127.0.0.1"
